    # 3
    paste0(
        "**3) Canadian Food Inflation: International Dynamics and Local Agency**<br>",
        "Nu\u00f1o-Ledesma (2023)<br>",
        "[Link](https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/cjag.12341)"
